# Maiden of the Dusk (WotG 51) at Status 3 without the Primal Glow: the Veridical Conflux plays 44 [89, 23, 1756, 0,
# 68032378, 209748094, 1] (Timer 0); its finish writes Timer 8001 and gives the Primal Glow (1731, message 6398). With
# it held: Grauberg [S]'s DefaultActions MYSTERIOUS_COLUMN_ROTATES (8387). With it taken (a GM) and the Timer ahead: the
# event 45 [89, 23, 1756, 0, 68032378, 209748094, 1], finished with no change; once per zone, so the next trigger gets
# 8387.
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/onEventFinish/38 GraubergS/onEventFinish/44 WalkOfEchoes/_521/onTrigger WalkOfEchoes/onZoneIn/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/6 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/7 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/8 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/4 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/5 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/6 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/7 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/8 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/9
